0067:     multiple recovered lines cross, the visible color is above every other line
0068:     through that cell. Return the unique ordering of all line colors that respects
0069:     those above/below constraints and whose consecutive colors are lines that
0070:     geometrically cross.
0071: 
0072:     Key insight
0073:     The visible crossing colors give a partial layer order, and the intended answer
0074:     is the unique Hamiltonian chain through the line-intersection graph from the
0075:     bottom layer to the top layer.
0076:     """
0077:     g = np.asarray(grid, dtype=int)
0078:     assert g.ndim == 2
0079: 
0080:     bg = get_bg(g)
0081:     lines = _infer_lines(g, bg)
0082:     colors = list(lines)
